# Optional API Keys for Vision / Multimodal Extraction
# Note: The system runs 100% offline deterministically with cached extractions in code/extraction_cache.json.
# If you want to perform live LLM extraction or test with new images, provide one of the keys below:

# Google Gemini Vision API Key (recommended: gemini-2.0-flash)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
# or GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# OpenAI Vision API Key (gpt-4o-mini)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
